WEBVTT

01:35.910 --> 01:40.860
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.590 --> 01:44.009
[Episode 6]

01:45.560 --> 01:46.509
Xueying.

01:46.680 --> 01:47.400
It's okay.

01:51.280 --> 01:52.840
-You're back.
-You're finally back.

01:52.840 --> 01:53.789
Will you dare to run off like that again?

01:53.789 --> 01:54.720
So disobedient.

01:58.400 --> 01:59.039
Yixiao.

01:59.680 --> 02:01.000
-Master!
-Master!

02:01.400 --> 02:02.230
Master.

02:02.310 --> 02:03.230
Master.

02:03.350 --> 02:04.800
You're finally back.

02:04.870 --> 02:06.870
Her Ladyship has been worried sick.

02:06.920 --> 02:07.590
How are you?

02:07.710 --> 02:09.110
You're not hurt, are you?

02:15.000 --> 02:16.190
Master.

02:16.870 --> 02:18.200
What are you crying for?

02:18.240 --> 02:19.280
I'm perfectly fine, aren't I?

02:19.280 --> 02:20.160
It's not like I died or anything.

02:20.160 --> 02:20.890
Stop crying.

02:21.960 --> 02:23.290
Did you practice today?

02:23.520 --> 02:24.450
Yes.

02:24.750 --> 02:25.720
Then let me see

02:25.750 --> 02:27.350
if you've made any progress.

02:45.560 --> 02:46.590
Since these kids

02:46.630 --> 02:47.240
arrived,

02:47.280 --> 02:48.910
the mansion has never been this lively.

02:48.910 --> 02:50.840
His Highness's never liked crowds.

02:50.840 --> 02:51.560
I wonder why

02:51.560 --> 02:52.710
he didn't lose his temper this time.

02:52.710 --> 02:53.800
Indeed.

03:10.000 --> 03:11.400
Alright, that's enough.

03:13.560 --> 03:15.160
You left and never came back.

03:15.530 --> 03:16.630
They've been crying the whole time,

03:16.630 --> 03:17.630
saying they'll never be naughty

03:17.630 --> 03:18.960
or make you angry again.

03:19.570 --> 03:20.570
Alright, Eleven,

03:20.680 --> 03:21.940
take them back to rest.

03:22.000 --> 03:22.590
Get some water

03:22.590 --> 03:24.920
and wash their faces and bodies properly.

03:28.710 --> 03:29.500
Go back now.

03:29.950 --> 03:31.120
If you dare run off again,

03:31.120 --> 03:32.250
you'll be punished.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.280
Got it.

03:33.750 --> 03:35.360
Let's go back and wash up, shall we?

03:35.360 --> 03:36.520
Let's go, Shunzi.

03:36.870 --> 03:37.680
Bath time.

03:37.710 --> 03:39.040
Bath time, Nine.

03:39.120 --> 03:39.680
Let's go.

03:47.030 --> 03:48.630
Who exactly kidnapped Fang?

03:50.300 --> 03:51.700
Some people from Jinxiu.

03:52.190 --> 03:53.120
Do you know them?

03:53.910 --> 03:55.630
They claimed to be my comrades.

03:55.630 --> 03:57.630
What kind of person
would treat their own comrades like this?

03:57.630 --> 03:58.650
From what I see,
there aren't many decent ones

03:58.650 --> 04:00.450
among you Jinxiu people either.

04:00.800 --> 04:01.360
Yixiao,

04:01.840 --> 04:02.970
you must be careful.

04:03.280 --> 04:04.190
I originally thought

04:04.190 --> 04:05.000
Feng Suige was

04:05.000 --> 04:06.360
a cold-blooded killer,

04:07.150 --> 04:08.280
but now I see

04:08.430 --> 04:09.150
that people from Jinxiu

04:09.150 --> 04:10.550
can't be trusted either.

04:10.580 --> 04:12.560
You're now deep in the heart of danger,

04:12.560 --> 04:13.760
with nowhere to turn.

04:14.430 --> 04:17.290
It's just about
surviving in desperate situations

04:17.360 --> 04:19.089
and seeking victory in danger.

04:20.720 --> 04:22.520
I'm just worried about the kids.

04:23.170 --> 04:24.230
Don't worry.

04:24.560 --> 04:25.960
There must be a solution.

04:32.340 --> 04:35.760
[Murong Residence] [Tea House] [Market]

04:39.430 --> 04:40.290
Your Highness.

04:41.620 --> 04:42.480
Your Highness.

04:42.830 --> 04:43.830
Those Jinxiu undercover guards

04:43.830 --> 04:45.000
who fell into the river have been found.

04:45.000 --> 04:45.890
None of them survived.

04:45.890 --> 04:47.040
But most importantly,

04:47.040 --> 04:48.430
their faces are completely disfigured,

04:48.430 --> 04:49.159
unrecognizable from

04:49.159 --> 04:50.290
what they once were.

04:50.510 --> 04:51.850
Should I have the coroner's artist

04:51.850 --> 04:52.920
try to reconstruct them,

04:52.920 --> 04:54.920
see if we can restore their appearance?

04:54.920 --> 04:56.320
No need to probe further,

04:56.600 --> 04:57.310
nor concern yourself

04:57.310 --> 04:58.909
with their real identities.

04:59.190 --> 05:00.920
As long as they're from Jinxiu.

05:01.680 --> 05:03.510
Hang their bodies from the city gate.

05:03.510 --> 05:05.240
At dawn, when the gates open,

05:05.270 --> 05:06.940
I'll let everyone know

05:08.680 --> 05:11.070
that Jinxiu sent assassins against me.

05:11.830 --> 05:12.630
Understood.

05:13.510 --> 05:15.510
But about that shipment of oil...

05:16.240 --> 05:17.160
Any news?

05:18.270 --> 05:19.060
No.

05:19.600 --> 05:20.070
The person in charge of oil

05:20.070 --> 05:22.390
at the Armaments Bureau has gone missing.

05:22.390 --> 05:24.070
Seems they've been silenced.

05:24.160 --> 05:25.030
Indeed.

05:25.240 --> 05:26.330
I've been thinking about that too.

05:26.330 --> 05:27.720
Are you saying

05:27.720 --> 05:28.630
someone actually coordinated with Jinxiu

05:28.630 --> 05:29.630
to take your life?

05:29.870 --> 05:30.830
Even Prime Minister Zhuang

05:30.830 --> 05:31.240
wouldn't dare

05:31.240 --> 05:32.190
be so blatant.

05:32.560 --> 05:33.630
This is happening right here
in Yujing City,

05:33.630 --> 05:34.680
under the Emperor's nose.

05:34.680 --> 05:35.120
So...

05:35.720 --> 05:37.190
Should I continue investigating?

05:37.190 --> 05:37.720
No need.

05:38.830 --> 05:40.870
This lead is already dead.

05:47.630 --> 05:49.630
Your Majesty, Her Highness is here.

05:52.370 --> 05:54.170
I pay my respects to you, Mother.

05:55.600 --> 05:57.730
I heard you couldn't sleep last night,

05:57.800 --> 05:59.800
so I had some calming tea prepared

05:59.950 --> 06:02.360
and found some century-old ginseng
from Mount Ling,

06:02.360 --> 06:04.890
hoping it will help you
sleep better, Mother.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.460
Among all these children,

06:14.840 --> 06:16.460
you're the sweetest.

06:16.950 --> 06:19.550
All the care I've given you
hasn't been in vain.

06:20.480 --> 06:21.340
Xiyang,

06:22.120 --> 06:22.830
do you know why

06:22.830 --> 06:24.290
I summoned you here today?

06:25.870 --> 06:26.870
You all may leave.

06:27.560 --> 06:28.190
Yes.

06:34.800 --> 06:35.870
I'm guessing,

06:36.600 --> 06:38.120
Mother, you summoned me here

06:38.120 --> 06:40.380
for the matter of the marriage alliance.

06:42.000 --> 06:43.720
You're always so clever,

06:43.830 --> 06:45.040
just as I like.

06:45.680 --> 06:47.070
That clever mind of yours

06:47.070 --> 06:48.730
really seems to take after me.

06:48.950 --> 06:50.830
You're just like my own daughter.

06:51.560 --> 06:52.360
You've always

06:52.360 --> 06:54.040
treated me as your own.

06:54.600 --> 06:55.630
I remember when we kids were little,

06:55.630 --> 06:57.270
Chengyang would always complain

06:57.270 --> 06:59.070
that you were biased in my favor.

07:01.310 --> 07:02.430
You've grown up now

07:03.270 --> 07:05.130
and reached the age for marriage,

07:06.120 --> 07:09.070
yet I'm so reluctant to let you go.

07:12.870 --> 07:14.540
I know you care for me.

07:15.430 --> 07:16.070
About this marriage alliance,

07:16.070 --> 07:17.530
since you already know,

07:18.670 --> 07:19.560
I'd like to hear

07:19.580 --> 07:20.940
your thoughts on it.

07:21.920 --> 07:22.770
Don't worry,

07:22.990 --> 07:24.290
if you're unwilling,

07:24.630 --> 07:25.990
no one can force you.

07:26.190 --> 07:29.090
But will Father agree?

07:29.270 --> 07:30.510
I'll decide for you.

07:31.510 --> 07:33.360
Even if your father gets angry,

07:33.380 --> 07:33.970
he can only

07:33.970 --> 07:35.440
blame me.

07:35.560 --> 07:37.070
I'd rather face his anger

07:37.100 --> 07:38.870
than let you suffer.

07:39.890 --> 07:42.120
Mother, you've taught me since childhood

07:42.120 --> 07:43.650
that as a princess of Susha,

07:43.830 --> 07:45.690
I must contribute to our kingdom,

07:46.310 --> 07:48.170
and I've always remembered that.

07:48.800 --> 07:49.560
Now

07:50.120 --> 07:51.240
is the time for me

07:51.260 --> 07:52.420
to serve Susha.

07:54.220 --> 07:55.880
So you mean...

07:56.510 --> 07:59.510
I'm willing to go through with
the marriage alliance.

08:10.870 --> 08:12.870
You've truly grown up now.

08:12.900 --> 08:14.560
Even when it comes to important matters
like marriage,

08:14.560 --> 08:16.390
you have your own thoughts.

08:16.600 --> 08:18.800
It really puts my mind at ease.

08:26.070 --> 08:27.430
Why did you mysteriously call me out

08:27.430 --> 08:28.790
so early in the morning?

08:29.310 --> 08:30.310
What's going on?

08:30.830 --> 08:31.390
I'm not planning to

08:31.390 --> 08:33.030
stay at Feng Suige's residence any longer.

08:33.030 --> 08:34.760
I can't eat or sleep well there.

08:35.030 --> 08:36.210
I'm planning to purchase

08:36.210 --> 08:37.210
a house in Yujing.

08:38.600 --> 08:39.500
Didn't we agree

08:39.600 --> 08:40.510
that you'd take the three kids

08:40.510 --> 08:41.909
back to Zhengnian Villa?

08:43.000 --> 08:43.789
Those three kids

08:43.789 --> 08:45.150
have their hearts set on you.

08:45.150 --> 08:46.200
We may have fooled them once,

08:46.200 --> 08:47.840
but can we fool them a second time?

08:47.840 --> 08:48.440
Besides,

08:48.720 --> 08:50.910
leaving Susha might not be safe either.

08:50.910 --> 08:51.960
I've thought it all through.

08:51.960 --> 08:53.270
Once you've finished your business,

08:53.270 --> 08:54.570
we can leave together.

08:55.250 --> 08:56.150
I'll handle my own affairs

08:56.150 --> 08:56.940
by myself.

08:57.030 --> 08:57.770
Don't worry.

08:58.000 --> 08:58.810
Actually, all these matters

08:58.810 --> 08:59.790
have nothing to do with you.

08:59.790 --> 09:00.870
You don't have to stay in Yujing.

09:00.870 --> 09:01.740
That won't do.

09:01.840 --> 09:03.120
You're someone I rescued,

09:03.120 --> 09:04.510
which makes you one of our own.

09:04.510 --> 09:06.240
Of course I need to protect you.

09:11.600 --> 09:12.930
Why are you so nice to me?

09:13.840 --> 09:15.160
Because you saved me.

09:15.390 --> 09:17.190
We share a life-and-death bond.

09:17.600 --> 09:18.600
I'm an only child,

09:18.750 --> 09:19.390
and I've always envied

09:19.390 --> 09:20.790
others who have sisters.

09:20.960 --> 09:22.960
Eleven is like a little sister to me.

09:22.960 --> 09:24.070
I've always wished

09:24.150 --> 09:25.610
I can have an older sister.

09:28.870 --> 09:30.670
Why don't you be my older sister?

09:31.720 --> 09:33.650
How about we become sworn sisters?

09:36.000 --> 09:37.000
What do you think?

09:38.870 --> 09:40.000
Would you like that?

09:41.720 --> 09:42.750
Would you?

09:44.030 --> 09:44.720
Alright,

09:45.200 --> 09:46.200
I'll do as you say.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.500
Then it's settled.

09:47.720 --> 09:48.960
From now on, we'll share our blessings

09:48.960 --> 09:49.960
and face hardships together.

09:49.960 --> 09:51.490
You're my older sister now.

09:53.030 --> 09:53.630
Sister.

09:54.960 --> 09:55.550
Sister.

09:56.120 --> 09:56.990
Sister.

09:57.080 --> 09:58.410
Call me too. Come on.

09:59.200 --> 10:00.080
Sister.

10:01.510 --> 10:02.080
Sister.

10:03.120 --> 10:03.750
Sister.

10:03.770 --> 10:05.900
From now on, I'll have an older sister!

10:11.120 --> 10:16.080
[Real Estate Agency]

10:12.630 --> 10:13.790
Here we are.

10:17.000 --> 10:18.570
I want the best house you have.

10:18.570 --> 10:21.570
-Honored guests, lease come in.
-I'm buying it today.

10:21.790 --> 10:23.000
So you're the young mistress

10:23.000 --> 10:24.080
of Zhengnian Villa.

10:24.080 --> 10:25.140
The house has been tidied up.

10:25.140 --> 10:26.140
This way, please.

10:30.090 --> 10:31.270
I'll need to sign
and put it on the account.

10:31.270 --> 10:32.530
Is that really doable?

10:32.680 --> 10:33.980
Of course.

10:34.150 --> 10:36.130
You're our most honored guest.

10:36.200 --> 10:37.790
Money is negotiable

10:37.810 --> 10:39.200
I'm putting it on your emperor,

10:39.200 --> 10:40.450
Feng Pingcheng's account, though.

10:40.450 --> 10:41.780
No problem. No problem.

10:42.080 --> 10:43.030
How do you two feel about

10:43.030 --> 10:44.610
this house? Are you satisfied?

10:44.610 --> 10:45.900
I'm quite satisfied.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.000
Thank you for your trouble.

10:47.000 --> 10:48.960
Then I shall take my leave

10:48.980 --> 10:50.580
and not disturb you further.

10:56.800 --> 10:58.150
Charging it to Feng Pingcheng's account?

10:58.150 --> 10:59.610
You're really something.

10:59.870 --> 11:01.910
That's actually doing Feng Pingcheng
a favor, alright?

11:01.910 --> 11:03.020
Whether it's Emperor of Jinxiu

11:03.020 --> 11:04.080
or Feng Pingcheng,

11:04.080 --> 11:05.150
they both want to earn favors

11:05.150 --> 11:06.030
with my Zhengnian Villa.

11:06.030 --> 11:08.000
Now that I've brought it to him myself,

11:08.000 --> 11:10.200
Feng Pingcheng will certainly accept.

11:10.600 --> 11:11.200
By the way,

11:11.360 --> 11:11.970
Sister,

11:12.080 --> 11:13.240
once I bring Fang here,

11:13.240 --> 11:14.120
this place will be

11:14.120 --> 11:15.390
our home in Yujing City.

11:15.390 --> 11:16.510
We have a home now!

11:21.200 --> 11:22.580
Come take a look.

11:22.630 --> 11:24.000
This will serve as a clinic,

11:24.000 --> 11:26.130
specifically for treating patients.

11:26.150 --> 11:28.080
And this area will be the pharmacy.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.510
Sister, there's also a garden in the back.

11:29.510 --> 11:30.570
I'll go take a look.

11:32.430 --> 11:33.790
We have a home now,

11:34.600 --> 11:36.150
a place to call our own here.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.240
Now, I can leave

11:37.240 --> 11:39.500
Feng Suige's residence whenever I want.

11:39.630 --> 11:40.270
But

11:40.270 --> 11:42.000
why don't I feel happy about it?

11:50.670 --> 11:51.470
Grandfather.

11:52.320 --> 11:53.090
I've been

11:53.120 --> 11:54.610
diligently practicing
my calligraphy lately.

11:54.610 --> 11:55.420
Please take a look.

11:55.120 --> 11:55.500
[A good man has built a hut in the valley
by the stream, so much at his ease.]

11:55.500 --> 11:55.770
[Alone he sleeps and speaks when awake,
and will surely not forget.]

11:55.670 --> 11:56.600
Have I made progress?

11:55.790 --> 11:56.000
[A good man has built a hut at the bend
of the mound, an air of indifference.]

11:56.000 --> 11:56.390
[Alone he sleeps and sings when awake,
and will never pass from the spot.]

11:56.410 --> 11:57.000
[A good man has built a hut
on the level height, so self-collected.]

11:57.000 --> 11:57.150
[Alone he sleeps, wakes and sleeps again,
and swears he will never tell.]

11:57.870 --> 11:59.670
Have you shown it to your father?

12:01.150 --> 12:02.080
Not yet.

12:02.840 --> 12:03.790
I was thinking

12:04.390 --> 12:06.240
of getting your guidance first,
Grandfather.

12:06.240 --> 12:07.440
After I make improvements,

12:07.440 --> 12:08.840
I'll show it to my father.

12:09.150 --> 12:11.210
Have you forgotten what I taught you?

12:12.150 --> 12:13.360
You said before

12:14.200 --> 12:15.870
that all of my writings

12:16.270 --> 12:18.270
must be reviewed by my father first.

12:18.320 --> 12:20.720
You must always keep in mind the proper
principles between ruler and subject.

12:20.720 --> 12:22.120
You are a prince of Susha.

12:22.510 --> 12:24.180
Apart from your tutors,

12:24.320 --> 12:25.250
only your father

12:25.360 --> 12:27.360
has the right to evaluate your work.

12:28.150 --> 12:28.870
Yes.

12:31.910 --> 12:32.710
Grandfather,

12:32.790 --> 12:34.550
I'm going to study now.

12:36.000 --> 12:36.860
I take my leave.

12:37.670 --> 12:39.720
Your handwriting is gentle and dignified,

12:39.720 --> 12:41.920
but lacks decisiveness and sharpness.

12:42.870 --> 12:43.670
Your father

12:44.270 --> 12:45.240
won't like it.

12:46.840 --> 12:48.240
Thank you, Grandfather,

12:54.080 --> 12:55.280
I shall take my leave.

13:06.030 --> 13:06.630
Father.

13:07.670 --> 13:08.360
Empress.

13:12.870 --> 13:15.630
You must be feeling more at ease
now that you've talked to Xiyang, right?

13:15.630 --> 13:16.320
Indeed.

13:17.510 --> 13:19.270
You're truly prescient, Father.

13:19.270 --> 13:20.600
But how did you know

13:20.630 --> 13:22.630
that Xiyang would certainly agree?

13:23.510 --> 13:24.960
Compared to Feng Suige,

13:25.720 --> 13:26.750
Chengyang's character

13:26.750 --> 13:27.880
is truly too gentle.

13:28.790 --> 13:30.390
He's not suited to be a ruler.

13:34.790 --> 13:37.200
But whether he is or isn't
doesn't really matter.

13:37.200 --> 13:39.130
The one who will inherit the throne

13:39.270 --> 13:40.670
can only be Chengyang.

13:42.150 --> 13:43.280
Chengyang's future

13:43.720 --> 13:45.580
depends entirely on you, Father.

13:45.920 --> 13:48.280
It's the future of the entire Zhuang clan.

13:51.720 --> 13:52.420
By the way,

13:52.840 --> 13:54.600
I heard that early this morning,

13:54.600 --> 13:55.670
Feng Suige hung the bodies of

13:55.670 --> 13:56.870
a few undercover guards from Jinxiu

13:56.870 --> 13:57.800
at the city gate,

13:58.120 --> 13:59.850
claiming he was assassinated.

14:00.200 --> 14:00.870
Do you think he'll

14:00.870 --> 14:02.010
ruin our plans?

14:02.240 --> 14:03.170
Since you already know

14:03.170 --> 14:04.080
the princess's thoughts,

14:04.080 --> 14:05.360
why should you worry?

14:06.400 --> 14:07.950
Father, you mean that

14:08.440 --> 14:09.410
no matter how Feng Suige

14:09.410 --> 14:10.640
interferes,

14:11.080 --> 14:12.720
His Majesty's final decision

14:12.720 --> 14:13.790
will depend on

14:13.840 --> 14:15.360
whether she's willing to go through with
the marriage alliance or not?

14:15.360 --> 14:17.190
If she's not willing,

14:17.720 --> 14:19.360
once she marries into Jinxiu,

14:19.360 --> 14:20.080
she will

14:20.550 --> 14:22.000
become a hidden threat.

14:22.510 --> 14:24.640
His Majesty surely understands this.

14:28.050 --> 14:32.740
[I, Fang Chengyu, Governor of Yuzhou,
kneel to submit this memorial]

14:38.920 --> 14:41.050
[Memorial]

14:46.200 --> 14:47.450
What did you just say

14:47.960 --> 14:49.650
you came here for today?

14:51.750 --> 14:54.080
I ask you to uphold justice
for me, Father.

14:57.660 --> 14:59.210
You've never

14:59.320 --> 15:00.630
asked me to intervene

15:00.630 --> 15:02.290
in anything since childhood.

15:02.440 --> 15:04.120
Today's matter is different.

15:04.720 --> 15:05.600
I encountered

15:05.600 --> 15:07.510
an assassination attempt
by Jinxiu's undercover guards

15:07.510 --> 15:08.840
and nearly lost my life.

15:09.390 --> 15:10.720
However, as it concerns Jinxiu

15:10.720 --> 15:12.750
and political affairs
between the two kingdoms,

15:12.750 --> 15:14.680
I dare not make decisions on my own.

15:14.870 --> 15:16.790
You hung those bodies at the city gate.

15:16.790 --> 15:18.450
You seem quite decisive to me.

15:18.510 --> 15:21.750
It doesn't seem that
you dare not make decisions on your own.

15:21.750 --> 15:23.320
Please understand, Father.

15:23.320 --> 15:24.930
It's only because the assassins' bodies

15:24.930 --> 15:26.160
were disfigured

15:26.440 --> 15:28.440
that I ordered them hung at the gate,

15:28.510 --> 15:29.150
only to

15:29.150 --> 15:30.870
help Jinxiu identify them

15:31.000 --> 15:32.600
and retrieve them promptly.

15:34.150 --> 15:35.710
How thoughtful of you.

15:37.150 --> 15:39.020
This is what I should do.

15:39.100 --> 15:40.290
Since it was Jinxiu

15:40.320 --> 15:42.200
who proposed the marriage alliance,

15:42.200 --> 15:44.200
though they speak sweetly but harbor evil,

15:44.200 --> 15:45.800
seeking peace on the surface

15:45.810 --> 15:47.780
while attacking in secret,

15:48.030 --> 15:49.440
I must still consider the dignity
of our kingdom

15:49.440 --> 15:51.040
and everyone's reputation,

15:51.120 --> 15:53.550
and cannot openly
tear our relations apart.

15:53.550 --> 15:55.270
Fortunately, I was lucky

15:55.510 --> 15:57.120
to survive this time.

15:57.910 --> 15:58.960
Even if Jinxiu

15:59.000 --> 16:00.600
continues to

16:00.600 --> 16:02.000
send assassins after me,

16:02.550 --> 16:04.390
as the First Prince of Susha,

16:04.440 --> 16:05.960
I must prioritize the bigger picture

16:05.960 --> 16:07.320
and practice restraint.

16:07.320 --> 16:08.320
All decisions

16:09.510 --> 16:11.350
are yours to make, Father.

16:11.510 --> 16:14.000
If the assassins' faces
are unrecognizable,

16:14.000 --> 16:15.200
how can you be certain

16:16.270 --> 16:17.960
that they were from Jinxiu?

16:18.670 --> 16:19.980
I have a witness.

16:20.240 --> 16:21.200
You haven't told me

16:21.200 --> 16:22.860
how I should repay this favor.

16:22.910 --> 16:23.900
It's simple.

16:24.200 --> 16:25.930
You just need to tell the truth.

16:26.120 --> 16:27.310
I need you to testify

16:27.390 --> 16:28.390
that those people

16:28.420 --> 16:30.280
are Jinxiu's undercover guards.

16:31.910 --> 16:32.620
That's it?

16:33.240 --> 16:34.360
Is it really that simple?

16:34.360 --> 16:36.160
Actually, it's not that simple.

16:36.390 --> 16:38.080
You need to consider that
agreeing to help me

16:38.080 --> 16:40.880
is equivalent to
betraying your former comrades.

16:41.080 --> 16:42.440
Otherwise, I'll kill him!

16:42.440 --> 16:43.960
They wanted to kill Fang.

16:45.150 --> 16:46.720
What kind of comrades are they?

16:46.720 --> 16:47.560
I'll help you.

16:51.200 --> 16:53.000
This is my witness's testimony,

16:53.200 --> 16:54.000
sufficient to prove

16:54.000 --> 16:55.860
the identity of those assassins.

16:57.840 --> 16:58.840
Your witness

16:58.870 --> 17:00.440
is that woman named Fu Yixiao,

17:00.440 --> 17:02.500
a female general from Jinxiu, right?

17:02.790 --> 17:04.829
She has lost her memory
and her background is unknown.

17:04.829 --> 17:06.369
Using her as a witness

17:06.550 --> 17:07.880
won't convince anyone.

17:08.589 --> 17:10.119
Then I request Your Majesty

17:10.640 --> 17:12.880
to reject Jinxiu's
marriage alliance proposal.

17:12.880 --> 17:14.640
This way, I can openly

17:14.680 --> 17:16.200
investigate the assassins' identities

17:16.200 --> 17:17.000
and offer you evidence

17:17.000 --> 17:19.130
that will convince everyone, Father.

17:20.109 --> 17:20.960
It's too late.

17:22.750 --> 17:23.960
Xia Jingshi

17:24.589 --> 17:26.430
will soon arrive in Yujing.

17:26.640 --> 17:28.720
I've already sent a reply to Jinxiu.

17:28.830 --> 17:30.440
The marriage alliance
between the two kingdoms

17:30.440 --> 17:31.920
has been decided.

17:36.880 --> 17:38.100
Please, Father,

17:39.790 --> 17:41.070
revoke that order.

17:41.400 --> 17:43.400
A ruler's word cannot be taken back.

17:43.960 --> 17:44.720
How can I revoke it?

17:44.720 --> 17:45.680
Whether to marry or not

17:45.680 --> 17:47.240
is just a matter of your word, Father.

17:47.240 --> 17:48.570
This matter is settled.

17:49.030 --> 17:50.890
There's nothing more to discuss.

17:51.110 --> 17:52.170
If that's the case,

17:52.400 --> 17:52.920
then I

17:52.920 --> 17:54.880
have one more unreasonable request!

17:54.880 --> 17:56.620
Since Jinxiu wants me dead,

17:56.920 --> 17:57.720
and since you, Father,

17:57.720 --> 17:59.110
don't care whether I live or die,

17:59.110 --> 18:00.840
then I beg you to issue the order

18:01.030 --> 18:02.240
that on the day Xia Jingshi

18:02.240 --> 18:04.060
marries Xiyang,

18:04.440 --> 18:05.920
grant me death.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.400
Consider it as adding some excitement

18:12.400 --> 18:13.930
to this marriage alliance!

18:15.670 --> 18:17.190
You think

18:18.310 --> 18:20.110
I don't have the heart to kill you?

18:20.110 --> 18:21.490
Of course you do!

18:21.670 --> 18:23.720
For the sake of
peace and self-preservation,

18:23.720 --> 18:24.350
you even have the heart

18:24.350 --> 18:25.530
to send your only daughter

18:25.530 --> 18:26.530
into hell!

18:26.640 --> 18:28.030
Of course you have no remorse

18:28.030 --> 18:30.240
about losing another son!

18:42.330 --> 18:44.470
If this marriage alliance
is to go through,

18:44.470 --> 18:46.850
it'll only be over my dead body.

18:57.430 --> 18:59.000
Please forgive me, Father.

18:59.240 --> 19:00.610
I heard everything from outside

19:00.610 --> 19:02.730
and didn't have the time
to request an audience properly.

19:02.730 --> 19:03.590
Xiyang?

19:03.610 --> 19:04.410
Xiyang.

19:05.010 --> 19:06.440
Now that you're here,

19:07.000 --> 19:08.870
tell him yourself.

19:12.350 --> 19:13.090
Brother.

19:15.640 --> 19:18.170
I'm willing to accept
the marriage alliance.

19:45.200 --> 19:46.530
Have you lost your mind?

19:47.510 --> 19:48.070
Brother.

19:48.440 --> 19:49.680
-Xiyang.
-I've always wanted to tell you that...

19:49.680 --> 19:50.920
You don't have to compromise

19:50.920 --> 19:52.270
and agree to this marriage alliance.

19:52.270 --> 19:53.750
I was about to win just now.

19:53.830 --> 19:54.590
I've been deliberately

19:54.590 --> 19:56.400
pressing the issue of the Jinxiu assassin,

19:56.400 --> 19:57.450
making sure all of

19:57.480 --> 19:58.740
Yujing knows about it,

19:58.790 --> 19:59.720
just to force Father

19:59.720 --> 20:01.050
to turn against Jinxiu.

20:01.680 --> 20:02.960
I provoked Father to sentence me to death

20:02.960 --> 20:04.350
to make him understand that

20:04.350 --> 20:06.200
If he insists on this marriage alliance,

20:06.200 --> 20:07.660
I, Feng Suige, will fight

20:07.690 --> 20:08.880
to the death to prevent it.

20:08.880 --> 20:09.680
I know you can't

20:09.680 --> 20:10.880
see the situation clearly now,

20:10.880 --> 20:12.350
but you only need to know that

20:12.350 --> 20:13.510
no one can force you

20:13.510 --> 20:14.710
to marry Xia Jingshi.

20:14.790 --> 20:16.380
Not even Father.

20:16.440 --> 20:17.110
Father has now

20:17.110 --> 20:18.310
painted himself into a corner.

20:18.310 --> 20:19.710
Be a little more patient,

20:19.750 --> 20:20.680
I will continue to find ways

20:20.680 --> 20:21.810
to pressure Father.

20:21.830 --> 20:23.000
Today, I'll definitely

20:23.000 --> 20:24.660
force him to revoke his order.

20:25.350 --> 20:26.160
Brother.

20:27.510 --> 20:29.270
Why have you never asked me

20:30.160 --> 20:32.490
whether I'm willing to marry Xia Jingshi?

20:36.310 --> 20:37.400
What did you say?

20:38.440 --> 20:40.840
Father sent someone
to ask about my wishes,

20:41.000 --> 20:42.440
and so did Mother.

20:43.590 --> 20:44.640
I've been waiting

20:45.240 --> 20:46.640
for you to ask me.

20:48.030 --> 20:49.830
What do you want me to ask you?

20:50.510 --> 20:51.110
Ask me

20:52.240 --> 20:53.440
if I'm willing

20:53.440 --> 20:54.640
to marry Xia Jingshi.

20:56.440 --> 20:57.110
Fine.

20:59.640 --> 21:00.500
I'm asking you.

21:01.270 --> 21:03.030
What is your wish?

21:04.350 --> 21:04.920
Actually, I...

21:04.920 --> 21:05.720
Feng Xiyang!

21:06.830 --> 21:09.690
You'd better think carefully
before you answer me.

21:14.030 --> 21:16.070
I'm willing to marry Xia Jingshi.

21:29.650 --> 21:30.500
Why?

21:31.750 --> 21:32.680
I like him.

21:33.860 --> 21:35.100
You've met him?

21:35.720 --> 21:36.850
A chance encounter,

21:37.590 --> 21:38.660
just once.

21:39.200 --> 21:41.330
He probably doesn't even remember me.

21:42.230 --> 21:43.980
You've only met him once,

21:44.400 --> 21:46.770
and you dare say you like him?

21:47.640 --> 21:48.270
Brother,

21:49.000 --> 21:50.590
when you meet the right person,

21:50.590 --> 21:51.800
once is enough.

21:51.880 --> 21:54.160
You're aware that he is my enemy.

21:54.720 --> 21:56.530
You've only met him once,

21:56.640 --> 21:58.110
but I'm your brother,

21:58.110 --> 21:58.920
Feng Xiyang!

21:59.110 --> 22:01.590
We are flesh and blood.

22:02.890 --> 22:03.970
Brother!

22:04.590 --> 22:05.800
Please grant my wish.

22:20.430 --> 22:21.740
I will not grant it.

22:27.920 --> 22:28.840
Brother.

22:29.730 --> 22:31.430
What have I done wrong?

22:31.680 --> 22:33.640
I just want to marry the man I admire,

22:33.640 --> 22:34.440
and this marriage alliance

22:34.440 --> 22:35.690
will bring peace.

22:35.830 --> 22:37.280
What wrong have I done?

22:37.640 --> 22:39.000
Because Xia Jingshi

22:39.000 --> 22:40.750
will always be Susha's enemy!

22:41.510 --> 22:43.350
No one knows him better than I do.

22:43.440 --> 22:44.960
I know his hypocrisy,

22:45.000 --> 22:46.350
his pretense,

22:46.370 --> 22:47.880
and his forbearance.

22:48.030 --> 22:49.030
Xia Jingshi's hands

22:49.030 --> 22:51.070
are stained with the blood of
our Susha warriors,

22:51.070 --> 22:52.590
and my sword is also soaked with

22:52.590 --> 22:54.240
the blood of his Jinxiu soldiers!

22:54.240 --> 22:55.720
Between me and Xia Jingshi,

22:55.720 --> 22:57.030
there can never be peace!

22:57.030 --> 22:57.890
Do you understand?

22:57.890 --> 22:58.830
That's because

22:58.830 --> 23:00.350
he hasn't met me before.

23:02.960 --> 23:03.960
Brother.

23:05.160 --> 23:06.380
Trust me,

23:07.240 --> 23:09.400
I will change Xia Jingshi.

23:10.110 --> 23:11.790
Why are you so naive?

23:12.680 --> 23:14.160
Would you dare say

23:14.550 --> 23:15.680
that you would never fall in love with

23:15.680 --> 23:17.070
a woman from an enemy kingdom?

23:17.070 --> 23:18.140
Never.

23:18.400 --> 23:20.400
I, Feng Suige, absolutely would not.

23:20.400 --> 23:21.310
Do you dare to swear

23:21.310 --> 23:22.670
that if you fall in love
with a woman from an enemy kingdom,

23:22.670 --> 23:23.880
you'll be struck by lightning?

23:23.880 --> 23:25.800
I, Feng Suige, swear to heaven,

23:26.030 --> 23:27.480
if I fall in love with a female general
from an enemy kingdom, I...

23:27.480 --> 23:28.160
Brother!

23:29.590 --> 23:31.510
Brother, I was wrong.

23:32.720 --> 23:33.590
I'm sorry.

23:34.510 --> 23:36.570
I shouldn't have forced you to swear.

23:37.720 --> 23:39.910
If someone must be struck by lightning,

23:39.910 --> 23:42.340
it should be me who bears it.

23:43.640 --> 23:45.030
I was wrong.

24:23.030 --> 24:24.460
It was my fault.

24:26.790 --> 24:28.650
Since you truly wish to marry him,

24:30.030 --> 24:31.690
I shouldn't stand in your way.

24:33.440 --> 24:35.040
I'll support your decision.

25:02.630 --> 25:05.450
[Wutong Mansion]

25:03.400 --> 25:04.240
Stop them!

25:05.920 --> 25:06.510
My Lady.

25:07.790 --> 25:08.590
Miss Ling.

25:10.030 --> 25:11.350
Are you going to leave just like that?

25:11.350 --> 25:13.280
I'm not a prisoner in your mansion.

25:13.440 --> 25:15.070
You've repeatedly tried to
stop me from leaving.

25:15.070 --> 25:16.270
Who gave you such audacity?

25:16.270 --> 25:16.830
Right.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.790
You're from Zhengnian Villa,

25:18.790 --> 25:20.680
and you're free to come and go
as you please.

25:20.680 --> 25:21.510
But this child Fang

25:21.510 --> 25:22.790
was rescued by His Highness.

25:22.790 --> 25:23.640
Without His Highness's permission,

25:23.640 --> 25:25.440
there's no way I could let him go.

25:25.640 --> 25:27.440
If your prince wants to
hold someone accountable,

25:27.440 --> 25:28.590
tell him to come find me.

25:28.590 --> 25:30.720
This is the First Prince's Residence!

25:31.790 --> 25:33.030
Not a place where you can come

25:33.030 --> 25:34.200
and go as you please.

25:34.310 --> 25:35.910
I say we can leave, so we will.

25:36.400 --> 25:36.830
But...

25:40.960 --> 25:43.370
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

25:43.960 --> 25:46.840
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

25:47.350 --> 25:49.390
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

25:50.120 --> 25:53.370
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

25:51.100 --> 25:53.990
[Wutong Mansion]

25:51.290 --> 25:52.150
Your Highness.

25:53.000 --> 25:54.240
They insist on moving out.

25:53.880 --> 25:56.120
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

25:56.910 --> 25:59.620
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

26:00.300 --> 26:06.130
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

26:06.570 --> 26:08.560
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

26:09.180 --> 26:12.820
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert ♪

26:13.250 --> 26:14.940
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

26:14.720 --> 26:15.400
You're leaving?

26:15.390 --> 26:19.160
♪ Who sighs for me, enduring separations ♪

26:16.550 --> 26:17.030
Yes.

26:19.660 --> 26:21.590
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

26:22.160 --> 26:25.010
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

26:25.750 --> 26:31.120
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

26:28.070 --> 26:28.680
Okay.

26:33.160 --> 26:33.690
Let's go.

26:34.400 --> 26:35.030
Get in.

26:34.850 --> 26:38.180
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

26:38.420 --> 26:40.290
[Wutong Mansion]

26:39.590 --> 26:40.050
Come on.

26:41.560 --> 26:44.330
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

26:41.720 --> 26:42.410
Get in.

26:44.710 --> 26:47.810
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

26:45.350 --> 26:46.950
Sister, get in the carriage.

26:48.240 --> 26:50.750
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

26:48.570 --> 26:49.400
You go ahead.

26:49.530 --> 26:50.820
I'll come find you later.

26:50.820 --> 26:53.990
[Wutong Mansion]

26:51.270 --> 26:53.950
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

26:54.430 --> 26:57.140
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

26:57.700 --> 27:00.540
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

27:00.970 --> 27:03.710
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

27:04.220 --> 27:07.330
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

27:07.740 --> 27:13.680
♪ All I ask is to be together  forever ♪

27:36.380 --> 27:39.420
♪ In the dark night, I look back ♪

27:39.860 --> 27:42.570
♪ Amid despair ♪

27:43.280 --> 27:45.600
♪ A grain of incense, a tear,
an inch of ash ♪

27:46.280 --> 27:49.110
♪ Gathered and parted, all for you ♪

27:51.020 --> 27:52.350
That area is a forbidden place
in the residence.

27:52.350 --> 27:53.840
No one can enter except His Highness.

27:52.800 --> 27:55.230
♪ You and I silently recite ♪

27:54.030 --> 27:55.390
Haven't you noticed something's off

27:55.390 --> 27:56.790
with His Highness today?

27:59.320 --> 28:01.750
♪ This love will never perish ♪

28:00.000 --> 28:01.490
I-Is there?

28:02.550 --> 28:03.410
Isn't there?

28:05.430 --> 28:07.930
♪ I search for you, yet cannot find you ♪

28:05.510 --> 28:06.650
Even if I told you,
you wouldn't understand.

28:06.650 --> 28:08.380
Just pretend you didn't see me.

28:21.400 --> 28:22.030
Mother.

28:23.360 --> 28:25.020
If your spirit is watching from heaven,

28:25.020 --> 28:27.840
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

28:25.380 --> 28:28.180
please don't blame Xiyang
for being disobedient.

28:28.720 --> 28:30.690
This is all my fault.

28:32.200 --> 28:33.660
Ever since we were little,

28:34.270 --> 28:36.000
I've only focused on doing everything

28:36.000 --> 28:37.400
to protect Xiyang.

28:38.920 --> 28:39.780
I never thought

28:40.790 --> 28:41.830
that because of this,

28:41.830 --> 28:43.310
she never truly experienced

28:43.310 --> 28:45.040
the treachery of human nature,

28:45.880 --> 28:47.550
which is why she's so naive.

28:50.550 --> 28:52.810
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

28:53.050 --> 28:55.090
This is all my fault.

28:56.440 --> 29:00.060
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

29:00.140 --> 29:04.950
[Virtuous and Serene, Honored in Peace]

29:28.310 --> 29:29.510
Weren't you leaving?

29:30.030 --> 29:31.490
Why did you follow me here?

29:31.640 --> 29:32.470
I'm confused.

29:33.110 --> 29:34.910
You didn't ask where I was going.

29:35.310 --> 29:36.640
If you wanted to tell me,

29:36.920 --> 29:38.180
you would have done so.

29:43.070 --> 29:44.330
What's wrong with you?

29:45.830 --> 29:47.890
Don't be like this. It's quite scary.

29:48.030 --> 29:49.070
Why did you go to the palace

29:49.070 --> 29:51.510
and come back like
a completely different person?

29:51.510 --> 29:52.830
The more unusual you act,

29:52.830 --> 29:53.930
the more I feel

29:54.110 --> 29:55.000
you're hiding some kind of

29:55.000 --> 29:56.230
scheme or plot.

30:06.310 --> 30:07.370
Come give me a hand.

30:16.000 --> 30:16.550
Come on.

30:19.830 --> 30:20.940
Such a big box.

30:21.200 --> 30:22.590
What's hidden in there?

30:23.550 --> 30:24.070
Could it be

30:24.070 --> 30:26.000
deadly weapons or magical armor?

30:26.400 --> 30:27.920
Who would bury magical armor

30:27.920 --> 30:28.900
in the dirt?

30:29.000 --> 30:30.130
Then it must be gold.

30:35.680 --> 30:37.030
It's actually wine!

30:38.830 --> 30:39.760
I never expected

30:39.790 --> 30:40.920
you had such a hobby.

30:43.000 --> 30:44.270
This is the Daughter's Red

30:44.270 --> 30:46.070
my mother left behind years ago.

30:46.200 --> 30:46.960
She told me

30:48.000 --> 30:49.160
it could not be opened

30:49.160 --> 30:50.890
until my sister's wedding day.

30:51.720 --> 30:52.910
Is your mother

30:53.110 --> 30:54.970
Empress Zhuang of Susha Kingdom?

30:55.790 --> 30:57.210
Her? Come on.

31:04.000 --> 31:04.990
Help me

31:05.070 --> 31:06.400
drink all this wine.

31:07.030 --> 31:07.960
The wine my mother left behind

31:07.960 --> 31:09.220
shouldn't go to waste.

31:09.270 --> 31:10.640
You've fought on battlefields

31:10.640 --> 31:12.040
as the Red-Clad General,

31:12.070 --> 31:14.730
so you should be able to
hold your liquor, right?

31:15.400 --> 31:17.160
So you won't wait
until your sister's wedding day?

31:17.160 --> 31:18.960
Xia Jingshi doesn't deserve it.

31:19.240 --> 31:21.240
I won't leave him even a single drop.

31:26.200 --> 31:28.720
I never thought
the mighty First Prince of Susha

31:28.720 --> 31:30.270
could be so childish.

31:31.000 --> 31:31.930
Who's childish?

31:34.790 --> 31:35.390
Well then.

31:36.270 --> 31:36.880
Today,

31:36.880 --> 31:38.410
I'll be childish this once.

31:45.050 --> 31:48.200
[Wutong Mansion]

31:48.560 --> 31:49.900
[Daughter's Red]

31:56.010 --> 31:58.460
[Daughter's Red]

32:20.750 --> 32:21.930
Your mother's wine

32:22.310 --> 32:23.370
isn't very strong.

32:26.400 --> 32:28.700
Looks like you really can
hold your liquor.

32:28.700 --> 32:30.510
I don't remember anything anyway,

32:30.510 --> 32:31.650
and I don't know

32:31.750 --> 32:33.220
what I'm good at

32:33.400 --> 32:34.790
or if I can handle alcohol well.

32:34.790 --> 32:36.050
Having it tested today

32:36.070 --> 32:38.400
actually brought me a pleasant surprise.

32:43.000 --> 32:43.590
Sometimes,

32:43.590 --> 32:44.750
I really envy you.

32:45.720 --> 32:47.350
Losing all your memories

32:48.550 --> 32:49.200
also means

32:49.220 --> 32:51.220
you've forgotten all your worries.

32:53.920 --> 32:55.520
That's not difficult at all.

32:55.720 --> 32:57.070
Although Xueying can't

32:56.740 --> 32:59.150
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

32:57.110 --> 32:58.430
cure my amnesia,

32:58.640 --> 32:59.870
if you need it,

32:59.730 --> 33:02.570
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

32:59.960 --> 33:01.720
she can write you a prescription

33:01.720 --> 33:03.200
and help you forget everything as well.

33:03.120 --> 33:05.170
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

33:03.270 --> 33:04.590
Given Xueying's medical skills,

33:04.590 --> 33:05.650
that won't be hard.

33:05.900 --> 33:09.220
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

33:06.240 --> 33:07.300
So, what do you say?

33:07.440 --> 33:08.570
Want to give it a try?

33:08.750 --> 33:10.640
One pill to cure all your sorrows.

33:09.650 --> 33:12.010
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

33:10.640 --> 33:12.040
That won't be necessary.

33:12.680 --> 33:15.390
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

33:12.720 --> 33:14.350
Let's not trouble Miss Ling.

33:16.080 --> 33:21.910
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

33:19.150 --> 33:21.070
But I'm actually quite curious.

33:22.350 --> 33:24.340
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

33:22.510 --> 33:24.960
What is it like

33:24.960 --> 33:28.070
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert ♪

33:25.310 --> 33:27.240
to lose all your memories?

33:30.750 --> 33:33.160
You open your eyes with no memory at all.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.720
You don't remember your history

33:36.110 --> 33:37.590
and your past,

33:38.960 --> 33:39.680
and you don't remember

33:39.680 --> 33:41.110
who you once hated.

33:42.030 --> 33:42.880
Nor do you remember

33:42.880 --> 33:43.940
who you once loved.

33:44.640 --> 33:46.640
What's even more ridiculous is that

33:46.830 --> 33:47.960
everyone around you

33:47.960 --> 33:49.070
knows who you are.

33:49.640 --> 33:51.370
They all know you're Fu Yixiao,

33:52.240 --> 33:53.900
but you yourself have no idea.

34:00.160 --> 34:01.160
That's not so bad.

34:05.310 --> 34:06.330
Not bad at all.

34:13.400 --> 34:14.000
By the way,

34:15.070 --> 34:16.710
was I famous

34:16.840 --> 34:18.370
in Susha in the past as well?

34:19.630 --> 34:21.090
You Three Heroes of Jinxiu

34:21.670 --> 34:22.800
are all Xia Jingshi's

34:22.800 --> 34:24.330
most prized subordinates.

34:24.510 --> 34:25.730
Ning Fei the fierce general,

34:25.730 --> 34:27.070
Xiao Weiran the strategist,

34:27.070 --> 34:28.290
and you, Fu Yixiao,

34:30.000 --> 34:32.489
Jinxiu's number one archer.

34:33.070 --> 34:34.580
In our Susha army,

34:34.630 --> 34:36.030
killing Ning Fei and Xiao Weiran

34:36.030 --> 34:37.280
earns the rank of battalion commander,

34:37.280 --> 34:38.380
and killing you, Fu Yixiao,

34:38.380 --> 34:39.840
earns company commander.

34:39.920 --> 34:41.340
So every soldier in Susha

34:41.440 --> 34:43.360
wants to claim your heads.

34:43.360 --> 34:44.520
That's outrageous!

34:46.360 --> 34:48.920
It's normal for soldiers
to seek military merit.

34:48.920 --> 34:50.580
No need to take it personally.

34:50.590 --> 34:52.590
Why does killing them
earn battalion commander,

34:52.590 --> 34:53.760
while killing me only earns
company commander?

34:53.760 --> 34:54.710
Which bastard

34:54.730 --> 34:55.580
set this rule?

34:58.710 --> 34:59.510
I did.

35:01.510 --> 35:02.580
You?

35:02.630 --> 35:04.400
Alright, when I get back to camp,

35:04.400 --> 35:06.330
I'll change the rule immediately.

35:06.800 --> 35:07.510
Killing you

35:08.030 --> 35:09.760
will also earn battalion commander.

35:09.760 --> 35:10.420
How's that?

35:10.710 --> 35:11.880
That's more like it.

35:15.590 --> 35:16.150
Do you

35:16.150 --> 35:17.690
look down on women a lot?

35:17.960 --> 35:19.320
Do you not believe women

35:19.340 --> 35:21.190
can also fight on the battlefield?

35:21.190 --> 35:22.320
Then let me ask you,

35:23.070 --> 35:23.960
when you were shot by

35:23.960 --> 35:25.710
the woman you despised the most

35:26.800 --> 35:28.190
with a single arrow,

35:28.880 --> 35:30.760
failing when victory was within reach

35:30.760 --> 35:32.430
and losing everything,

35:32.960 --> 35:34.120
how did it feel?

35:35.550 --> 35:38.000
How could you bring up one's painful past
to their face?

35:38.000 --> 35:38.930
Don't you get it?

35:38.930 --> 35:40.030
Tearing open wounds
right to someone's face

35:40.030 --> 35:41.360
is the most satisfying.

35:41.400 --> 35:42.000
I've helped you

35:42.000 --> 35:43.060
drink so much wine.

35:43.150 --> 35:43.810
Now tell me.

35:46.030 --> 35:47.440
How did it feel...

35:48.630 --> 35:49.630
Nothing special.

35:50.190 --> 35:52.250
Victory and defeat are common in war.

35:55.230 --> 35:56.380
Didn't you

35:56.760 --> 35:58.570
want to cut me down with one stroke?

35:58.570 --> 35:59.780
Not only that.

36:01.800 --> 36:03.110
I wish I could

36:03.110 --> 36:05.970
cut you into pieces,
tear you limb from limb,

36:06.190 --> 36:09.450
have you drawn and quartered,
and grind your bones to dust.

36:34.590 --> 36:35.370
Alright.

36:35.550 --> 36:36.920
Once we find out the truth,

36:36.920 --> 36:38.840
my life is yours to do with as you please.

36:38.840 --> 36:40.670
But you're already quite lucky.

36:40.880 --> 36:41.800
At least you know

36:41.800 --> 36:43.030
who your enemy is.

36:43.550 --> 36:44.610
What about me?

36:44.760 --> 36:45.770
Xueying said

36:45.880 --> 36:47.550
I was shot dead within five steps

36:47.550 --> 36:49.150
by the person closest to me.

36:50.150 --> 36:51.210
Until now,

36:51.440 --> 36:53.570
I still don't know who that person was.

36:54.070 --> 36:55.070
Compared to me,

36:55.850 --> 36:58.310
you're not feeling
quite so bad now, are you?

37:04.000 --> 37:05.480
Then it seems

37:06.550 --> 37:08.320
I should help you find

37:08.320 --> 37:10.120
your killer as soon as possible.

37:13.150 --> 37:14.030
Good wine!

37:24.910 --> 37:29.060
[Sentry Station,
Border Pass of Susha Kingdom]

37:27.700 --> 37:28.360
Stop!

37:33.440 --> 37:34.800
This is Susha's territory.

37:34.800 --> 37:35.840
Who are you?

37:40.570 --> 37:43.510
[Pass]

37:41.050 --> 37:42.910
Please take me to your commander.

37:44.230 --> 37:45.320
Follow me.

37:47.300 --> 37:50.550
[Susha Border]

37:52.260 --> 37:55.080
[Susha Border]

37:55.160 --> 37:58.120
[Susha]

37:56.110 --> 37:57.230
Following Your Highness
to fight against Susha

37:57.230 --> 37:58.360
for so many years,

37:58.400 --> 37:59.710
I've dreamed every night

37:59.710 --> 38:01.150
of marching with Your Highness
to conquer Susha

38:01.150 --> 38:02.150
and storm Yujing.

38:02.320 --> 38:03.520
I never expected that

38:03.710 --> 38:04.590
the first time

38:04.120 --> 38:05.650
[Susha Border]

38:04.630 --> 38:06.150
I see Susha's boundary marker in my life,

38:06.150 --> 38:07.370
I'd have to hold back

38:07.710 --> 38:09.120
from smashing that darn thing.

38:09.120 --> 38:11.350
[Susha Border]

38:13.440 --> 38:14.300
Your Highness,

38:14.670 --> 38:16.510
are you really going to marry
Susha's princess?

38:16.510 --> 38:17.530
We could simply rescue Yixiao

38:17.530 --> 38:18.580
and leave.

38:19.710 --> 38:22.280
[Susha Border]

38:26.920 --> 38:27.720
Let them pass!

38:28.960 --> 38:30.890
Your Highness, we can proceed now.

38:30.920 --> 38:31.840
From here to Yujing

38:31.840 --> 38:33.100
is still over 400 miles.

38:33.100 --> 38:35.700
We've been traveling day and night
these days.

38:35.810 --> 38:37.140
Even if we can endure it,

38:37.670 --> 38:38.670
the horses can't.

38:40.000 --> 38:42.060
There's a post station not far ahead.

38:42.070 --> 38:43.190
Do you think we should...

38:43.190 --> 38:45.760
Then let's rest at the post station
for the night

38:45.760 --> 38:47.440
and head to Yujing City tomorrow.

38:47.440 --> 38:47.880
Yes.

38:47.920 --> 38:48.280
Yes.

39:11.150 --> 39:15.190
Why does a hero not wield the Wu sword,

39:17.190 --> 39:21.480
seizing the 50 prefectures
of mountain passes?

39:23.550 --> 39:26.800
At Red Cliff's cape,
the eternal waves roar.

39:28.000 --> 39:32.800
On the Copper Dyke road,
the midnight moon shines.

39:35.760 --> 39:38.300
Draw the carved bow, aim at Sirius.

39:39.630 --> 39:41.360
In the cold frost and dawn moon,

39:41.510 --> 39:44.770
with steel and horse, crush Susha!

39:55.550 --> 39:56.960
So you still remember

39:57.630 --> 39:59.920
your poem in the Jinxiu Army.

40:07.230 --> 40:07.840
Come on,

40:09.030 --> 40:09.890
recite with me!

40:10.070 --> 40:11.410
Saddle in the snow,

40:11.630 --> 40:12.800
sword at my waist.

40:12.960 --> 40:15.850
I won't return until Jinxiu is conquered!

40:19.150 --> 40:20.660
Saddle in the snow,

40:20.800 --> 40:22.290
sword at my waist.

40:22.440 --> 40:22.970
Sword...

40:25.960 --> 40:27.020
Give me your sword.

41:58.260 --> 42:00.560
♪ Arrows skim through fleeting light ♪

42:01.110 --> 42:03.530
♪ In the blink of an eye ♪

42:03.920 --> 42:06.990
♪ Scattering among clouds and mist ♪

42:06.110 --> 42:07.320
You're drunk.

42:10.440 --> 42:12.440
♪ I fall off a cliff ♪

42:12.070 --> 42:13.750
Who are you?

42:12.880 --> 42:15.450
♪ My wings, in an instant ♪

42:14.000 --> 42:15.320
You know me?

42:16.010 --> 42:19.110
♪ Shatter into sand ♪

42:16.760 --> 42:18.150
What are you to me?

42:19.030 --> 42:21.000
Before today, we were enemies.

42:19.550 --> 42:21.590
♪ Who once laughed at frost ♪

42:21.890 --> 42:24.740
♪ Riding across the world with ease ♪

42:22.230 --> 42:23.500
From today...

42:24.630 --> 42:25.230
That's not right.

42:25.210 --> 42:28.610
♪ And who was swept away toward ♪

42:27.110 --> 42:28.110
Who am I?

42:29.280 --> 42:31.090
♪ That muted darkness ♪

42:29.510 --> 42:31.480
I don't remember who I am.

42:31.450 --> 42:32.230
♪ Who once ♪

42:32.550 --> 42:37.190
♪ Melted me with a gaze like a river ♪

42:32.590 --> 42:34.120
Will everyone in this world

42:34.710 --> 42:37.030
forget who I am?

42:37.590 --> 42:39.410
Not remembering who you are?

42:38.310 --> 42:43.940
♪ You're the answer in my heart ♪

42:39.670 --> 42:40.630
You wish.

42:41.850 --> 42:43.260
You're Fu Yixiao.

42:43.960 --> 42:46.490
I'd recognize you
even if you turned to ashes.

42:46.630 --> 42:47.960
Good that you remember.

42:48.710 --> 42:49.670
That's good.

42:50.170 --> 42:51.910
♪ I have resolved ♪

42:52.270 --> 42:55.310
♪ To ignite a body of sparks ♪

42:53.670 --> 42:54.470
You're drunk.

42:55.550 --> 42:57.010
I'll take you back to rest.

42:57.590 --> 42:58.760
Thank you.

42:59.230 --> 43:00.840
You're a good person,

43:01.300 --> 43:03.690
♪ Like arrows, falling like rain ♪

43:01.760 --> 43:02.630
and good people

43:04.070 --> 43:10.180
♪ Reaching with burning intensity ♪

43:04.320 --> 43:05.510
will be rewarded.

43:09.070 --> 43:10.630
I brought you into the enemy kingdom

43:10.490 --> 43:12.500
♪ Who laughed at frost ♪

43:12.440 --> 43:14.000
and put you in mortal danger.

43:12.860 --> 43:15.550
♪ Riding across the world with ease ♪

43:15.710 --> 43:17.510
How could I possibly be a good person?

43:15.980 --> 43:19.440
♪ And who was swept away toward ♪

43:19.980 --> 43:21.720
♪ That muted darkness ♪

43:20.550 --> 43:22.510
What a beautiful, full moon.

43:22.090 --> 43:22.800
♪ Who once ♪

43:23.040 --> 43:28.010
♪ Melted me with a gaze like a river ♪

43:28.070 --> 43:29.710
What moon are you talking about?

43:29.310 --> 43:34.870
♪ You're the answer in my heart ♪

43:32.800 --> 43:35.230
Why is the moon so close to me?

43:40.770 --> 43:42.730
♪ I have resolved ♪

43:43.020 --> 43:45.870
♪ To ignite a body of sparks ♪

43:44.920 --> 43:46.070
So the moon

43:47.030 --> 43:48.960
feels like this.

43:50.400 --> 43:52.550
Soft and bouncy.

43:51.910 --> 43:54.690
♪ Like arrows, falling like rain ♪

43:53.670 --> 43:55.070
And it's warm.

43:54.960 --> 43:58.700
♪ Reaching with burning intensity ♪

44:03.930 --> 44:06.010
♪ Through clouds and mist I wander ♪

44:06.480 --> 44:12.170
♪ Watching the stars scatter their light ♪
